2026-07-27T10:14:00.6214746Z i /tmp/Rtmp97eSkm/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:14:00.6215107Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:14:00.6215512Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:14:00.6215875Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:14:00.6216417Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:14:00.6217480Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:14:00.6218287Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
